	"@context": "tb",
	"data": "Goal: Node Visualization\n\nRender thought bubbles as 3D objects with type-based appearance, size, color, and behavior.\n\nWhat This Is\nThe visual language of the spatial thought graph. Bubbles aren't uniform — their appearance encodes their type, state, and relationships.\n\nVisual Properties Needed\nShape — sphere (default thought), card (skill node), panel (document), crystal (reference)\nColor — by category (concept=blue, project=green, person=orange, journal=purple, infra=gray)\nSize — by…",
